Mon Aug 24 2026 Anton Isaiev <totoshko88@gmail.com> - 0.20.8
- Version bump to 0.20.8
- Fixed: the sidebar context menu did not open when there was no room for it
  below the pointer — the menu's minimum height was its full content, around
