  a fixed dark background carried theme-coloured labels, so Copy, Paste and
  Autotype were near-black on near-black. All embedded toolbars now follow the
  local theme
- Fixed: config writes contended with each other inside a single process,
  logging "waiting for another rustconn instance" with no other instance
  running; the wait was unbounded from the GTK thread, the async write held a
  blocking lock, and a single failure in the shutdown flush discarded all three
  pending files
- Fixed: one credential lookup opened 25 encrypted Secret Service sessions — a
