Fri Aug 21 2026 Anton Isaiev <totoshko88@gmail.com> - 0.20.5
- Version bump to 0.20.5
- Fixed: Flatpak terminal still started at 24x80 on some hosts — the host
  shell now starts once the terminal widget has been allocated, so the
  host-side PTY that script creates inherits the real size (issue #294)
